{"id":4017,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/object-pronouns/","parentId":540,"order":70,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Object pronouns vs subject pronouns: Me or I, she or her?","seo":{"title":"Object pronouns vs subject pronouns: Me or I, she or her? - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use object pronouns in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1%E2%80%93Grammar-object-pronouns-subject-pronouns.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T10:18:16","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct subject pronouns or object pronouns to complete the following sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"462\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Replace the underlined words with the correct subject pronouns or object pronouns.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"463\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Complete the sentences using the correct subject pronouns or object pronouns.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"464\"></div>"],"explanation":"<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10951\" src=\"/media/uploads/Object-pronouns_Subject-pronouns_new-1.png\" alt=\"Grammar chart distinguishing between subject pronouns 'I, you, he, she, it, we, they' and object pronouns 'me, you, him, her, it, us, them' with example sentences.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>Subject pronouns</h2> <h4>Subject: Before the verb</h4> <p><strong>Subject pronouns </strong>are the subject of a verb. They go before the verb.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><span><strong><em>I</em></strong></span><em>&nbsp;</em><em>like your dress.</em></li> <li><span><strong><em>You</em></strong></span><em>&nbsp;</em><em>are late.</em></li> <li><strong><em><span>He</span>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>is my friend.</em></li> <li><strong><em><span>It</span>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>often rains</em><em>.</em></li> <li><strong><em><span>She</span>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>is on holiday.</em></li> <li><strong><em><span>We</span>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>live in England.</em></li> <li><strong><em><span>They</span>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>come from London.</em></li> </ul> <h2>Object pronouns</h2> <h4>Object: After the verb</h4> <p><strong>Object pronouns </strong>are the object of a verb. They go after the verb.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Can you help&nbsp;</em><strong><em><span>me</span>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>, please?</em></li> <li><em>I can see&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>you</em></strong></span><em>.</em></li> <li><em>She doesn’t like&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>him</em></strong></span><em>.</em></li> <li><em>I see&nbsp;</em><strong><em><span>her</span>&nbsp;</em></strong><em>every Monday.</em></li> <li><em>We can see&nbsp;</em><strong><em><span>him</span></em></strong><em>, but he can’t see&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>us</em></strong></span><em>.</em></li> </ul> <h4>After preposition</h4> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>object pronouns&nbsp;</strong>after prepositions.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>She is there&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>for me</em></strong></span><em>.</em></li> <li><em>I’ll get it&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>for you</em></strong></span><em>.</em></li> <li><em>Give it&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>to him</em></strong></span><em>.</em></li> <li><em>Can you listen&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>to her</em></strong></span><em>?</em></li> <li><em>Don’t take it&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>from us</em></strong></span><em>.</em></li> <li><em>I want to speak&nbsp;</em><span><strong><em>to them</em></strong></span><em>.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":462,"questions":[{"id":4031,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>What time can I call <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["him","he"]}]},{"id":4035,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> never listens to <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Him","He"]},{"kind":"select","options":["us","we"]}]},{"id":4036,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>'Do you like my new glasses?' 'Yes, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> love <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["me","I"]},{"kind":"select","options":["them","they","it"]}]},{"id":4037,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Tom loves his rabbits. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> plays with <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> in the garden every day. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["He","Him"]},{"kind":"select","options":["them","they"]}]},{"id":4038,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Please, call <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> soon; <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> am very worried.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["I","me"]},{"kind":"select","options":["me","I"]}]},{"id":4039,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Look, Sara and Kevin. Can you see <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>? </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["they","you","them"]}]},{"id":4040,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Tell John that <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> can meet <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> at the canteen.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["him","he","she"]},{"kind":"select","options":["they","us","we"]}]},{"id":4041,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I like your earrings. Can <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> see <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["I","me"]},{"kind":"select","options":["them","they"]}]},{"id":4044,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Look at that man. Who is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["he","him"]}]},{"id":4045,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>That man over there is David. I work with <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["he","him","her"]}]}]},{"id":463,"questions":[{"id":4032,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I can't find <strong><span>my keys</span></strong>. ⇒ I can't find <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4048,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong><span>Rachel</span></strong> helps <strong><span>the students</span></strong>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> helps <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4056,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need to tell <strong><span>John</span></strong> the truth. ⇒ I need to tell <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the truth.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4053,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong><span>My dad and I</span></strong> love <strong><span>chocolate</span></strong>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> love <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4054,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong><span>Suzan and Tom</span></strong> call <strong><span>their daughter</span></strong> every day. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> call <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> every day. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4058,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I like cooking <strong><span>for my children</span></strong>. ⇒ I like cooking for <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4055,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Give <strong><span>the documents</span></strong> to <strong><span>Carmen</span></strong>. ⇒ Give <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4057,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><strong><span>Tom</span></strong> often plays football with <strong><span>my friends and me </span></strong>. ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> often plays football with <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4060,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>How old is <strong><span>Emma</span></strong>? ⇒ How old is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4059,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need <strong><span>the scissors</span></strong> to cut <strong><span>the paper</span></strong>. ⇒ I need <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to cut <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":464,"questions":[{"id":4033,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm not dangerous. Don't be afraid of <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4034,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't like this music; <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> is boring. Can you stop <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4042,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>That's my money. Can you give <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>? I need it.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4043,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Susan is in trouble and <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> needs help. We have to help <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4046,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Jack is very special. I think I'm in love with <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4047,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We are going to the cinema. Do you want to come with <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4049,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't want to eat this cheese. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> smells horrible. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4050,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Don't eat cookies. <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> are very unhealthy.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4051,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I can't find Sally. Where is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":4052,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> need help. Can you help us?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}